 "deviations_from_design": [
  "ideal_world without run_bindStart (decision envGD without bindStart, design-v2 section 15; guide U6 fourth part open point 2 as corrected).",
  "ideal_world_slots conjoins IdealSlots or Anomaly (an equality); the design bound on D_g without IdealSlots is the pair ideal_world_slots_le / ideal_world_slots_ct.",
  "run_origins stated one level below PqxdhRecordLiftProtocol.run (on the record compiler, extending run_erasure) and lifted by run_factor; no new per-command proof (PqxdhRecordLiftWorldProvenance.handler_origins).",
  "originMap generic in the slot count (originMap_two links it to PqxdhDeploymentIdealTrace.originSlots).",
  "evalDist_le_add stated with the evalDist notation only (VCVio probEvent notation deprecated).",
